#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1640
msgid "Renders a scrolling marquee banner using texts that are scheduled in the Rolling Texts table. Only entries whose start/stop window includes the current server time are shown. Multiple simultaneous entries are joined by a long dash (—)."
msgstr "Viser et rullende marquee-banner med tekster, der er planlagt i tabellen Rullende tekster. Kun poster, hvis start/stop-vindue omfatter den aktuelle servertid, vises. Flere samtidige poster sammensættes med en lang tankestreg (—)."

