#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1658
msgid "Roller ID (required). Must match the Roller ID of at least one entry in the Rolling Texts table. Use lowercase letters, numbers and hyphens — e.g. \"homepage\", \"events-sidebar\"."
msgstr "Roller-ID (påkrævet). Skal matche Roller-ID'et for mindst én post i tabellen Rullende tekster. Brug små bogstaver, tal og bindestreger — f.eks. \"homepage\", \"events-sidebar\"."

#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1663
msgid "Behaviour"
msgstr "Adfærd"

#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1665
msgid "When no entry is active the shortcode outputs nothing — the banner simply disappears."
msgstr "Når ingen post er aktiv, udsender shortcoden ingenting — banneret forsvinder simpelthen."

#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1666
msgid "Multiple overlapping entries are concatenated with  —  between them."
msgstr "Flere overlappende poster sammensættes med  —  mellem dem."

#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1667
msgid "Schedule entries under Vis → Calendar → Rolling Texts. The Roller ID in that form must match the id attribute used in the shortcode."
msgstr "Planlæg poster under Vis → Kalender → Rullende tekster. Roller-ID'et i den formular skal matche det id-attribut, der bruges i shortcoden."

#: includes/class-pcio-vis-admin.php:1668
msgid "Different pages can show different banners by using different id values."
msgstr "Forskellige sider kan vise forskellige bannere ved at bruge forskellige id-værdier."

